[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238343\">5040D22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the screws.</p><p>2. Displace the cover only a little.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections (3a, 3b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Hazard warning lights switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236122\">H20A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Hazard warning lights switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236125\">H20B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019239.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Make sure that the cover is\nnot damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical  connections.</p><p>Place the cover.</p><p>Screw the screws.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238343\">5040D22</a></p><p>Check the functioning of the reassembled\ncomponents.</p>"]]